<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT NIGERIA 2-1 IN HASSAN TROPHY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CZECH REPUBLIC BEAT NIGERIA 2-1 IN HASSAN TROPHY.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech Republic beat Nigeria</p>
<p>2-1 (halftime 1-0) in the Hassan soccer trophy on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Czech Republic  - Drulak Radek 9, Hasek Martin 79</p>
<p>Nigeria - Mobi Oparaku 87 penalty</p>
<p>Attendance - 80,000</p>
